This relates to netscape V4.61 crashing often when using the vertical
scrollbar or the page up/down keys with DU 4.0E with patchkit #2.

After trying the suggestions offered (some listed in previous summary)
which included downloading netscape V.4.7, but none helped -- we were
finally able to apply the fix suggested by Compaq:  delete and reinstall
the open3d kits. The idea was that the patch kit reverted the kits to an
earlier version. Don't know if this is the case because the version of O3D
we'd installed (then patched) was V4.9A and the version we reinstalled is
V4.96.

