Bob's suggestion:
=============

Netscape Java is very sensitive to missing fonts, and the supplied list
is
stupidly Sun-specific. Try copying
/usr/lib/font.properties.truepointsize
to $MOZILLA_HOME/java/classes/font.properties

Bob

