The answer was to add "options PROCFS" to my /sys/conf/SYSTEMNAME file.

As suggested, I added it to the file, did a doconfig, copied the new kernel
to / and rebooted - life is good again!

Thanks to:

Mandell Degerness
Erik Persson
Tom Webster
Steve Hancock

Thanks!

Jim

